# HQ linking (later)

Do not build the bridge in the local MVP. Keep the model in mind so the schema does not block it.

- A link is optional and agreed on both headquarters. Either side can unlink immediately.
- Link the apps. Do not merge meshes or share community channel secrets.
- Crossing traffic is aid bulletins, chosen alerts, and check-in counts. Direct messages, the roster, and GPS tracks stay local.
- The same short bulletin must be deliverable over MeshCore and over IP. Queue it when the other side is quiet.
- Stamp the origin headquarters and a hop count. Cap relay at one hop unless an operator raises it.
- A linked headquarters cannot enroll devices or run local bot commands.
